<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Industrias Penoles.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Industrias Penoles.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued one million European-style call warrants, on Industrias Penoles SA de CV, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    $3.40		     PREMIUM	15.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $0.46		     GEARING	7.2 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   17.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	30.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   =			   MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  $3.33</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
